# SIH2026 / SIH26108

This is an AI-powered procurement standards intelligence platform, not a chatbot.

## Do not

- Fabricate BIS metadata, standard numbers, or BIS URLs
- Treat UNKNOWN as a positive factual claim
- Claim certification or QCO obligations without authoritative data
- Let the LLM independently invent or select standards
- Copy the testing2 demo wholesale
- Commit secrets, `.env` files, API keys, or service-role keys
- Design production around SQLite
- Implement later phases unless the user asks

## Retrieval contract (future)

User query/document → normalization → requirement extraction → lexical retrieval → semantic retrieval → metadata filtering → candidate fusion → reranking → relationship expansion → compliance/lifecycle enrichment → evidence extraction → confidence calculation → recommendation.

The LLM explains evidence-backed pipeline results only.

## Current phase

Phase 0 — Foundation. Stop after the requested phase.
